    ('a4057ca6-8123-45d9-b213-91e18a1b9193'::uuid, 'card_description', 'Some sixty-five rooms once ringed the courtyard of this large Roman villa. Its north wing holds most of the fine mosaics, floors among the most complete and intricate in the country.', 'Around a courtyard in West Sussex, Bignor Roman Villa grew to some sixty-five rooms, its mosaic floors among the most complete and intricate in the country, most of them in the north wing.', 'teaser-card-s036-rollback:a4057ca6-8123-45d9-b213-91e18a1b9193:card_description', 'rollback of teaser-card-s036: card_description ''Around a courtyard in West Sussex, Bignor Roman Villa grew to some sixty-five rooms, its mosaic floors among the most complete and intricate in the country, most of them in the north wing.'' restored on Bignor Roman Villa', '73bef914409bb054de8bdfedb309d576d71751c933f7754c3aef8317ec201098|7395adf527512245ef9ae9b4c6672cfa89b8004a2038e2d7a9ce52effef03694|7395adf527512245ef9ae9b4c6672cfa89b8004a2038e2d7a9ce52effef03694', '[{"source": "lane WB run wb-shorts-pilot3-2026-10-20: writer card_writer:teaser-write-003", "url": "output/remediation/teaser/runs/wb-shorts-pilot3-2026-10-20/OUTCOMES.jsonl", "quote": "Some sixty-five rooms once ringed the courtyard of this large Roman villa. Its north wing holds most of the fine mosaics, floors among the most complete and intricate in the country."}, {"source": "lane WB run wb-shorts-pilot3-2026-10-20: checker card_fact_checker:teaser-check-003 (check), PASS", "url": "output/remediation/teaser/runs/wb-shorts-pilot3-2026-10-20/OUTCOMES.jsonl", "quote": "in its final form the villa had some sixty-five rooms [S6]; the rooms surrounded a courtyard [S6]; it is a large Roman villa [S1]; most of the fine mosaics are in the north wing [S7]; its mosaic floors are some of the most complete and intricate in the country [S2]"}, {"source": "lane WB run wb-shorts-pilot3-2026-10-20: verifier card_web_verifier:teaser-verify-004 (verify), VERIFIED", "url": "output/remediation/teaser/runs/wb-shorts-pilot3-2026-10-20/OUTCOMES.jsonl", "quote": "Some sixty-five rooms once ringed the courtyard of this large Roman villa. [SUPPORTED: https://www.historyhit.com/locations/bignor-roman-villa/]; The villa had a courtyard that its rooms surrounded. [SUPPORTED: https://www.roman-britain.co.uk/places/bignor-roman-villa/]; It is a large Roman villa. [SUPPORTED: https://sussexexclusive.com/a-visit-to-bignor-roman-villa-west-sussex/]; Its north wing holds most of the fine mosaics. [SUPPORTED: https://www.roman-britain.co.uk/places/bignor-roman-villa/]; The villa''s mosaic floors are among the most complete in the country. [SUPPORTED: https://www.roman-britain.co.uk/places/bignor-roman-villa/]; The villa''s mosaic floors are among the most intricate in the country. [UNVERIFIABLE, no proving quote: None]"}]'::jsonb),
    ('ac3877a0-04fc-4049-b918-ebf41b0a1501'::uuid, 'card_description', 'A pile of bones lies at the bottom of a cliff in this ruined city. Special spots were set aside for human sacrifice, and the remains of one young woman were found well preserved.', 'The dry desert kept the Cerro Pátapo Ruins remarkably well preserved: a Wari city near Chiclayo with special spots set aside for human sacrifice and a pile of bones at the foot of a cliff.', 'teaser-card-s036-rollback:ac3877a0-04fc-4049-b918-ebf41b0a1501:card_description', 'rollback of teaser-card-s036: card_description ''The dry desert kept the Cerro Pátapo Ruins remarkably well preserved: a Wari city near Chiclayo with special spots set aside for human sacrifice and a pile of bones at the foot of a cliff.'' restored on Cerro Pátapo Ruins', 'fc08215f7936882d08bd14e9082118768905f3299c52ab8b5398f632079c7024|e90fbb682f59655e3bb1de7e8053272678e53b4c08ab70e43f6595355eb9bc98|e90fbb682f59655e3bb1de7e8053272678e53b4c08ab70e43f6595355eb9bc98', '[{"source": "lane WB run wb-shorts-pilot3-2026-10-20: writer card_writer:teaser-write-003", "url": "output/remediation/teaser/runs/wb-shorts-pilot3-2026-10-20/OUTCOMES.jsonl", "quote": "A pile of bones lies at the bottom of a cliff in this ruined city. Special spots were set aside for human sacrifice, and the remains of one young woman were found well preserved."}, {"source": "lane WB run wb-shorts-pilot3-2026-10-20: checker card_fact_checker:teaser-check-003 (check), PASS", "url": "output/remediation/teaser/runs/wb-shorts-pilot3-2026-10-20/OUTCOMES.jsonl", "quote": "a pile of bones lies at the bottom of a cliff at the site [S6]; the site is the remains of a city [S1]; special spots were set aside for human sacrifice [S6]; the remains of one young woman were found [S7]; her remains are well preserved [S7]"}, {"source": "lane WB run wb-shorts-pilot3-2026-10-20: verifier card_web_verifier:teaser-verify-004 (verify), VERIFIED", "url": "output/remediation/teaser/runs/wb-shorts-pilot3-2026